[en.FOCUS_C01_C03_DELIVERY]
Labor is Magic

[en.FOCUS_C01_C03_DELIVERY_desc]
It seems that it is a bit difficult to inquire about Duchess Derpy’s background simply by infiltrating Cloudsdale. It has been so long that even we have forgotten a simple fact: Derpy is a Ponyville pony, not a Cloudsdale pony.\nBefore becoming a Duchess, Derpy was a mailpony in Ponyville, maybe we should start investigating from the Ponyville post office.

[en.FOCUS_C01_C03_DELIVERY_TOOLTIP]
We will arrange for agents to work in the Ponyville post office to see if we can inquire about Derpy’s information from there.

[zh.FOCUS_C01_C03_DELIVERY]
劳动是魔法

[zh.FOCUS_C01_C03_DELIVERY_desc]
似乎单纯通过渗透云中城的方法打听呆蹄领主的消息有点困难。时间太久，以至于连我们都忘记了一个简单的事实：呆蹄是一只小马谷的小马，而不是云中城的小马。\n在成为公爵之前，呆蹄是小马谷的邮递员，也许我们应该从小马谷的邮局开始调查。

[zh.FOCUS_C01_C03_DELIVERY_TOOLTIP]
我们将会安排特工进入小马谷邮局工作，看看能否从中打听到关于呆蹄的消息。

